cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use VintageBench, please cite it as below. Please also cite the data
  sources listed in data/NOTICE.md.
type: software
title: VintageBench
abstract: >-
  A benchmark testing whether AI analysts reason correctly about provisional
  data that is later revised, using US macroeconomic data vintages from the
  Real-Time Data Set for Macroeconomists (Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia).
authors:
  - family-names: Jyoti
    given-names: Divya
version: 0.0.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/divyajyoti-dev/vintagebench"
url: "https://github.com/divyajyoti-dev/vintagebench"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - large language models
  - data revisions
  - real-time data
  - RTDSM
  - economic data
